<title>USA: Olympic Financial debt priced.</title>
<headline>Olympic Financial debt priced.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympic Financial Ltd said Thursday that $725 million of its automobile receivables-backed securities were priced through Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp as lead manager.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co Inc and J.P. Morgan &amp; Co were co-managers.</p>
<p>The transaction, when added to the remaining 1996-B prefund that was completed this quarter, gives Olympic the possibility of selling up to $765 million of auto loans in the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
